'''Pestilence''' is a [[Harbinger]] that can appear in all environments of [[Chapter 2]] ({{s|Caves}}, {{s|Catacombs}}, {{s|Flooded Caves}}).

== Behavior ==
=== Phase 1 ===
* Floats around the room, leaving a large trail of damaging [[Creep#Green Creep|Green Creep]].
* Fires an {{i|Ipecac}} projectile at Isaac, which leaves Green Creep on impact.
* Summons two {{e|Charger}}s or {{e|Spitty|text=Spitties}} and can have a maximum of four summons.
** Any Chargers or Spitties caught in Pestilence's Ipecac explosion will be killed.

=== Phase 2 ===
After taking enough damage, Pestilence's head will explode, beginning the second phase.
* No longer moves around the room but slowly drifts around, leaving Green Creep.
* Continues to fire Ipecac projectiles at Isaac, but at a faster rate.
* Summons two {{e|Attack Fly|text=Attack Flies}}.

Pestilence deals a whole heart of contact damage in both phases, though without flight Isaac is more likely to be damaged by the Green Creep instead.

== Champion Versions {{unlockable}} ==
: {{bc|2}}: Leaves a trail of slowing [[Creep#White Creep|White Creep]] instead of Green Creep, shoots 6 projectiles in all directions instead of an Ipecac shot and spawns {{e|Trite}}s instead of Chargers or Spitties. He cannot spawn more than 3 Trites at once. It spawns {{e|Spider}}s instead of Attack Flies in Phase 2.

